Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/mfs/mfs_file.c
Line: 401
Function: mfs_write
Bug type: heap-buffer-overflow
CWE: CWE-122
Explanation: In append mode, a negative size decreases buf_size and memcpy is called with a huge size_t due to signed-to-unsigned conversion, causing writes past the end of the heap buffer.

Source context:
